.TH INVOICE-DESK 1 "2026-11-18" "Invoice Desk" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
invoice-desk \- bilingual (Arabic/English) desktop invoicing for freelancers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B invoice-desk
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invoice Desk keeps clients, invoices, contracts and quotes in one offline
SQLite database and exports vector A4 PDFs. It has no account, no cloud and
no network access.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B INVOICE_DESK_DATA_DIR
Use this folder for the database, settings and default backups instead of
the per-user data folder. Useful for trying the app on throwaway data.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/me.omarmaarouf.invoice_desk/
The database, settings and default backups. Installing, upgrading or
removing the package never touches it.
